  "endingVerification": "The Scimitar destroys the Sea Cat power pod. Sharon reports Thorpe incapacitated, then confirms the mission is complete. The story awards 100/100 and presents the restore/restart/quit prompt; choose QUIT.",
  "intro": [
    "Start a fresh Sea Stalker Release 15 game and enter the requested name. This deterministic route uses seed 1035 and reaches 100/100 in 213 story moves.",
    "The route clears the lab alert, prepares the Scimitar, crosses Frobton Bay without grounding, fixes the depth regulator, and docks at the Aquadome.",
    "At the Aquadome, gather evidence, identify the threat, prepare the dart gun and bazooka, install the fine sonar grid, and expose Bill Greenup before returning to sea.",
    "The final encounter requires the exact response sequence to Tip, Dr. Thorpe, and Sharon. The route ends after the winning scene and quits at the post-ending prompt; no player death occurs."
  ],
